{"nodes": [{"id": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "label": "JOURNAL.md (Run 007, spec-loop)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "feature_settings_shell", "label": "settings-shell (feature)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_wavesequencing", "label": "Wave sequencing rationale (shared file territory)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "lib.rs, App.tsx, TerminalHeader.tsx and commands/terminal.rs are shared territory touched by multiple tasks across features (multi-terminal/T14, T16; agent-selection/T5; settings-shell/T1; terminal-statuses/T5). To avoid concurrent-edit conflicts, tasks touching the same file are serialized into different execution waves instead of running in parallel."}, {"id": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_aclgap", "label": "ACL capabilities gap (kanban/settings windows)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "src-tauri/capabilities/default.json only lists \"windows\": [\"main\"], so neither the kanban window nor the new settings window appear in the capability. Under Tauri 2 ACL this suggests no invoke() call from those windows would be permitted at runtime, which would block task-kanban/T7 (invoke('task_delete')/invoke('task_send')) and all of settings-shell/T2 navigation. Not fixed in run 007 \u2014 no queued task authorized editing capabilities/default.json for this purpose; flagged for the next spec-triage with priority, since if confirmed it is a real bug blocking two whole windows."}, {"id": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_terminalidgap", "label": "TerminalId integration gap (rename UI has no real path)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The real TerminalId returned by pty_spawn only exists today as a local variable inside TerminalPane.tsx; it never propagates up to App.tsx nor down into TerminalHeader.tsx. So even though the manual-rename UI (multi-terminal/T16) and the terminal_set_title command are complete and compile, there is no real end-to-end path to exercise them today. Same gap class that originated task T12; needs a future task wiring TerminalPane -> App.tsx -> TerminalHeader."}, {"id": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_t8needsdecision", "label": "task-kanban/T8 blocked \u2014 architecture decision needed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only task-creation path (tasks::service::create) requires a TerminalContext and derives project_id from cwd \u2014 it does not accept an explicit project. Three options were surfaced: (1) expand T8 to add task_create to the backend plus decide manual terminal_id semantics; (2) split into a backend task and a UI task; (3) reduce this round's criterion (no project selector) with an explicit AD admitting the reduction. Marked \u26d4 NEEDS-DECISION in task-kanban/tasks.md; no file was touched by the attempt."}, {"id": "specs_runs_006_2026_08_02_triage", "label": ".specs/runs/006-2026-08-02/TRIAGE.md (Run 006)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "specs_project_execution", "label": "EXECUTION.md (task execution bookkeeping)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "git_cliff_tool", "label": "git-cliff (changelog generator, cliff.toml)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_triage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_runs_006_2026_08_02_triage", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "feature_multi_terminal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "feature_task_kanban", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "feature_release_distribution", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "feature_agent_selection", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "feature_terminal_statuses", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "feature_settings_shell", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_wavesequencing", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_aclgap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_terminalidgap", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal_t8needsdecision", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs/runs/007-2026-08-03/JOURNAL.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "specs_runs_007_2026_08_03_journal", "target": "specs_project_state", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".specs